## Video drivers/hardware acceleration. Please avoid translating 'OpenGL' and 'ANGLE'.

preferences-video-driver = Videodriver
preferences-video-driver-opengl-mac = OpenGL (anbefalt på Mac)
preferences-video-driver-software-mac = Programvare (ikke anbefalt)
preferences-video-driver-opengl-other = OpenGL (raskere, men kan forårsake feil)
preferences-video-driver-software-other = Programvare (tregere)
preferences-video-driver-angle = ANGLE (kan fungere bedre enn OpenGL)
preferences-video-driver-default = standard
